From 722713fb7b75079677b429f94a63f8059107af99 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "sh.chao" <sh.chao@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 21 Jul 2026 10:12:24 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] r25-2-0096: execute bounded ordered native lines

Promote generation-2 format 5 from shadow measurement to one pixel-owning holder replay. Preserve exact bytecode order: canonical commands stay in PDFium while proven opaque two-point strokes draw from immutable owned geometry and state.

Cull native work with ordered holder-space leaves and exact live bounds, restore PDFium clip state at native boundaries, preserve live optional-content visibility and render-option color translation, fall back per dirty object, match canonical degenerate-matrix handling, and check cancellation every 64 commands. Reuse path and state storage without per-line candidate allocations or a second bitmap.
